menu "Robot arm axis"

    config AXIS_NODE_ID
        int "CAN node id of this axis (1-6)"
        range 1 6
        default 1
        help
            Selects this board's entry in the axis config table (components/axis_core) and its CAN node id.
            Set it per board before flashing, e.g. `idf.py menuconfig` or `-D SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS=...`.

endmenu
